<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1584f194a833> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3157] \"UnitedHealthcare is responsible for the health care needs of some of our most vulnerable populations,\" said Ryan Clarkson, managing partner of Clarkson Law, in a statement." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3157" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/405dabc57408> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3158] UnitedHealthcare, the largest health insurance provider in the US, is using an AI algorithm called nH Predict whose wildly inaccurate predictions are being used to deny health coverage to severely ill patients by cutting the time they can spend in extended care." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3158" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/57c2a36f89b1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3156] UnitedHealthcare, a unit of UnitedHealth Group (NYSE: UNH), is facing a federal lawsuit over its use of an artificial intelligence tool in making Medicare Advantage claims denials for patients in extended care facilities." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3156" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/999f072b3cec> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Coverage decisions are based on CMS coverage criteria and the terms of the member’s plan." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3156" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7e5a1842e294> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Aaron Albright, a spokesperson for Optum, the unit of UnitedHealth involved in the lawsuit’s claims, told Skilled Nursing News that the AI tool used in assessing claims is more for guidance and not for denial of insurance claims." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3156" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/23e7b2737968> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"UnitedHealthcare is responsible for the health care needs of some of our most vulnerable populations,\" said Ryan Clarkson, managing partner of Clarkson Law, in a statement." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3157" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/25456c67bf3f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "a report from the Inspector General of the US Department of Health and Human Services found that private Medicare Advantage programs deny 13 percent of service authorization requests" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3157" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7705c29c374d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Medicare Advantage is a privately-run, government-approved version of the federal Medicare program" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3157" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/97f5bef3ec9a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "NaviHealth doesn’t just manage nursing home care within UnitedHealth’s plans, but also serves large Medicare Advantage insurers such as Humana and many regional health plans — potentially affecting the care of more than 15 million people, or half of all Medicare Advantage enrollees." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3156" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ab46a7f6c1da> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The complaint, brought by Clarkson Law Firm, alleges UnitedHealthcare unlawfully deployed an AI system with a 90 percent error rate" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3157" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/f664a56f170a> a airo:AISystem ;
    rdfs:label "NaviHealth" ;
