<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/05fec3d9074a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Their grievances are corroborated by an investigation from Stat News into UnitedHealth's internal practices at its subsidiary NaviHealth, which found that the company forced employees to unwaveringly adhere to the AI algorithm's questionable projections on how long patients could stay in extended care." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3158" .

